            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For all households, transaction mail per household fell by 17.3 pieces per household per year (or 15.6 percent) from 111.0 in FY2024 to 93.7 in FY2025 from the previous year, crossing the FY2025 methodology break.",
            "metric": "transactions-per-household",
            "years": [
              2024,
              2025
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For the $100,000-$149,999 income group, transaction mail per household dropped by 56.4 pieces per household per year (or 38.6 percent) from 146.2 in FY2020 to 89.8 in FY2025, across the FY2024 and FY2025 methodology breaks.",
