          },
          {
            "text": "For the 65 and Over age group, transaction mail per household decreased by 58.1 pieces per household per year (or 30.3 percent) from 191.5 in FY2020 to 133.4 in FY2025, across the FY2024 and FY2025 methodology breaks.",
